# Compact UI defaults

For UI design, implementation, and review, read and apply
`.agents/skills/hallmark/references/topgsm-compact-ui.md` from the repository root.
It defines the shared sizing defaults, disclosure rules, and viewport checks.
These project defaults take precedence over generic design-skill guidance about
oversized heroes, display typography, generous whitespace, and layout variety.
